        1   using Progress.Lang.*.
        2   using ibs.th.adm.upd.*.
        3   block-level on error undo, throw.
        4   class ibs.th.adm.upd.analisdf final:
        5       define variable obsrvdbObj as class observupd no-undo.
        6       define property TargetDBShm as integer no-undo
        7       get.
